    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:317f93b6edfb6783aa8ddfa9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最强的──────！\n喝啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "100850e995e7ebad1914487623191e44db4e73a5e4e87d20fac7c71ac87b9cd0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072323.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        51,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55dab57a8edcd44c78cfadc7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果八重无敌能像参加“日本德比”时\n那样发挥潜力──",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b99287026394c604497e50983cb4eb1d5a955df98f1a5a6b2b72eb2167d30fb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072323.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        52,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/52/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1705c51dc0539a761f650eba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果她能跟当时一样渴求“执着”，\n在奔跑时赤裸裸地表现出感情……\n或许有机会将其化为武器。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8908f5c6bc3bedd0f77df60e4ab410a3fb210cd9fad9b3b8a2608906e0808228",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072323.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        53,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/53/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0031da40ea2f93072d03c06e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我认为八重无敌奔跑的本质在于斗争心。\n很明显地，她在燃起斗争心时\n更能发挥出实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9d5176d7a0431b05fd7ada9b3fc5e0b0a97dde64df89216f880ba4676005c27",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072323.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        54,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/54/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:216390977f690cd2863dc951",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但相对地，一旦斗争心过于强烈，\n就会变得无法控制。所以她才要将\n“火水合一”练得更加完美以控制斗争心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3771d6c28a008ec43066a79bf47624d5925085917bc78d6a04779e0deb710e81",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072323.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        55,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/55/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72807e2945a3d39f8b570880",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "获得“执着”后，\n她展现出更胜以往的强烈斗争心……\n不过如果一口气将其完全解放……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac6fc6a0d203ddfcbecd2e9f4327929e583ae6d1f3a02a4781c57aa8a4bf3a9c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072323.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        56,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/56/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80dee9de070f107a0a0cb484",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就会产生无法驾驭感情造成失控的风险。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8daebfbd6f5c86fc2490630082f2d1c305ff81856692e7dcc9ec76282e83d729",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072323.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        57,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/57/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c82923f150408dfd789659f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──虽然本人没有发现，\n但八重无敌今天跑得非常轻松。\n这是因为东京赛场非常宽广。",
      "source_fingerprint": "978f3ee5aacecf2cc6557d5666f409b5f281c77e67c1fcb7748feb468167913a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072323.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        58,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/58/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cbf81fdc3f5cee71b755f87",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她跑步时会很在意周围的赛马娘，\n所以宽广的赛道能让她的心情比较轻松。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00914314f54ef3322825edb2c12feffc859c161b07738b5ba41e653b7a667a2b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072323.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        59,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/59/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55862f405137c856b1fbae2c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f8749c61e463993203f028a53ae89fef3f073f64e22cb59f4ca74097de4dc9b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072323.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddaab0e02f610ca8b4ecbb72",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她总是小心谨慎地不让自己失控，\n所以我犹豫着该不该建议她\n在比赛时彻底解放斗争心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dffd8c04fdece30b267941b66f3e2cd2b5e9d35a0f8f0f092e073d047bb54f73",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072323.json",
      "json_path": [
