      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……说得也是。\n如果轻易就能找到必胜的方法，\n大家就不需要那么辛苦了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae60d5cebc7d5e1f4ad7fab0c96469ea35817bd580396233967c3292d73c2097",
