    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06113fafb5b7ff40a75daa27",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使前途多舛看不见希望，\n她依然能够继续扎实地努力，\n我想她迟早能靠这份胆识超越小栗帽。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0f59e1e7c5a6cf1616852e3821e8ac4b5808257de9661e41cf2708c3c81a40a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
